# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in what you need. Vite reads this
# (separately from .dev.vars, which wrangler reads for worker-side secrets).
# Nothing here is required for the $0 setup.

# Optional. Sends uncaught client-side errors to Sentry (sentry.io, free
# tier). A Sentry DSN is meant to be public (it's embedded in every client
# bundle by design - it can only send events, not read your data), but you
# still need your own to see the errors. Leave unset and nothing changes.
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
